  abilityDesc: 30 combo Fire, Thunder attack on all foes, 6 combo Fire attack on
    single foe (damage relative to remaining HP), boosts Atk, Def for 3 turns, boosts
    Atk relative to Def for 3 turns, spark damage fills BB gauge for 3 turns & adds
    probable 1 turn Atk, Def reduction infliction to attack for 3 turns
